excerpt: 'In this paper, Alexandra Dirksen, Hendrik Erz and I have examined the ethical oversight mechanisms in computer science in a scoping review. We found that these mechanisms are highly fragmented and fail to fulfil their objective of protecting research participants from harm. We conclude by proposing a framework for how these problems might be addressed. '
